Package: dodo-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: labwc, waybar
Description: Dodo look: labwc theme, Waybar style, wallpaper and marks
 The "Mauritius" look of the Dodo desktop: a labwc window theme named
 Dodo (rounded title bars, soft shadows), a Waybar stylesheet, the lagoon
 wallpaper and the Dodo marks used by the panel.
 .
 Files only: nothing is enabled for existing users. Select the theme in
 labwc's rc.xml (<theme><name>Dodo</name>) and point Waybar at
 /usr/share/dodo/waybar/style.css.
